<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-eyebrow">
    <span class="dot"></span>
    Now available on iOS
  </div>

  <h1>Stoke the<br><em>obsession.</em></h1>

  <p class="hero-sub">The wanting. The craving. The "I can't wait to get home to you" feeling. Whether you're trying to get it back, or never let it go.</p>

  <p class="hero-body">
    <strong>Any flame can burn out.</strong><br>
    Stoke shows you exactly what to do. One or two personalized actions each week. This is love compounded.
  </p>

  <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/stoke-for-couples/id6753605202" class="app-store-btn" target="_blank">
